    <briefdescription>
<para>Context object provided to custom migration lambdas. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Grants access to the underlying storage and metadata about the current migration so that custom callbacks can read, transform, and re-write records as needed.</para>
<para><heading level="3">Example</heading>
</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="normal">migration.addCustomMigration([](MigrationContext&amp;<sp/>ctx)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>it<sp/>=<sp/>ctx.createIterator(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;users&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">while</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(it-&gt;valid())<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>val<sp/>=<sp/>it-&gt;value();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>…transform<sp/>val…</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ctx.storage-&gt;put(it-&gt;key(),<sp/>val);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>it-&gt;next();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">return</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">true</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">});</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
